Error [E0074]: this yielding loop produces incompatible item types
  --> tests/ui/yielding_loop_item_mismatch.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |         if item == 1 -> item else -> "two"
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
